msgid "**FIG-16 is a current mechanism view, not a hardware qualification diagram.** The upper group shows build-time facts and generated objects. The lower group shows runtime calls. Solid arrows carry their written meaning; dashed arrows mark an explicitly optional mechanism. No arrow creates a scheduler, worker, global device registry or implicit hardware discovery."
