msgid "One authored TOML assembly selects reviewed SoC modes and Board routes. The strict resolver checks fields, capacities and resource constraints before publishing immutable typed IR and an atomic generated bundle. CMake remains the only software target graph. An invalid input does not select a convenient fallback or leave a usable partial configuration."
msgstr "One authored TOML assembly selects reviewed SoC modes and Board routes. The strict resolver checks fields, capacities and resource constraints before publishing immutable typed IR and an atomic generated bundle. CMake remains the only software target graph. An invalid input does not select a convenient fallback or leave a usable partial configuration."

msgid "The generated factory returns an existing static face by typed identity. Lookup does not allocate, initialize hardware, read silicon, acquire locks or start tasks. After explicit startup, ordinary I/O calls the face's shared read-only operations table with the instance's private context. Applications own execution progress, scheduling and shutdown. Optional enhanced faces share their intended controller owner; a second face does not grant a second hardware executor."
msgstr "The generated factory returns an existing static face by typed identity. Lookup does not allocate, initialize hardware, read silicon, acquire locks or start tasks. After explicit startup, ordinary I/O calls the face's shared read-only operations table with the instance's private context. Applications own execution progress, scheduling and shutdown. Optional enhanced faces share their intended controller owner; a second face does not grant a second hardware executor."

