msgid "Startup dependencies must form a directed acyclic graph. A runtime event chain may contain an explicitly autonomous cycle, but its declared stop owner must own the whole cyclic component and its stopping action must cut every cycle. This is a configuration proof about supplied facts, not proof that silicon has stopped. IRQ, DMA, bus and request drain still follow their provider contracts."
