msgid "A device group and Flash density cannot prove an exact orderable part, package or PCB. Revision rules bind a reviewed source digest and required workaround mask; the helper does not authenticate that source or prove a workaround was implemented. Unknown revisions require rejection or an explicit unreviewed policy. That policy cannot bypass a blocked revision, missing observation, device or density mismatch, or missing required workaround."
